msgstr "Use WooCommerce default recipient"

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:305
msgid "Efterlad tom for at bruge modtageren fra WooCommerce nye ordre-mails."
msgstr "Leave empty to use the recipient from the WooCommerce new order emails."

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:325
msgid "Antal år fortrydelsessager opbevares. Maksimum er 5 år."
msgstr "Number of years withdrawal cases are kept. The maximum is 5 years."

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:343
msgid "Styrer sproget i formular, mails, handelsbetingelsernes afsnit og pluginnets admin-sider. Uændrede standardtekster skifter automatisk sprog, når du gemmer. Tekster du selv har tilpasset, ændres ikke."
msgstr "Controls the language of the form, emails, the terms and conditions section and the plugin admin pages. Unchanged default texts switch language automatically when you save. Texts you have customised yourself are not changed."

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:378
msgid "Valgfri tekst der vises i en infoboks lige før \"Bekræft fortrydelse\"-knappen. Brug fx til information om specialfremstillede varer. Efterlad tom for at skjule boksen. Simpel HTML som links og fed skrift er tilladt."
msgstr "Optional text shown in an info box right before the \"Confirm withdrawal\" button. Use it, for example, for information about custom-made goods. Leave empty to hide the box. Simple HTML such as links and bold text is allowed."

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:397
msgid "Kundekvitteringen må kun bekræfte modtagelse af anmodningen. Den må ikke formuleres som en endelig godkendelse eller refundering."
msgstr "The customer receipt may only confirm receipt of the request. It must not be worded as a final approval or refund."

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:437
msgid "Slet pluginets data ved afinstallering."
msgstr "Delete the plugin data when uninstalling."

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:450
msgid "Her kan du tilpasse teksten, der indsættes i WooCommerce ordremails (behandler-/færdigbehandlet-mails). Efterlad et felt tomt for at bruge pluginets indbyggede standardtekst (som også oversættes automatisk via WPML/Polylang). Udfyld felterne, hvis du fx også sælger specialfremstillede varer, der ikke er omfattet af fortrydelsesretten."
msgstr "Here you can customise the text inserted into WooCommerce order emails (processing/completed emails). Leave a field empty to use the plugin's built-in default text (which is also translated automatically via WPML/Polylang). Fill in the fields if, for example, you also sell custom-made goods that are not covered by the right of withdrawal."

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:451
msgid "Slår du linket til fortrydelse fra nedenfor, vises kun PDF-noten i mailen (fx til shops, hvor kunden ikke skal have et direkte link til fortrydelsesfunktionen)."
msgstr "If you turn off the withdrawal link below, only the PDF note is shown in the email (e.g. for shops where the customer should not get a direct link to the withdrawal function)."

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:471
msgid "Vis info-boks med link til digital fortrydelse i kundens ordremails."
msgstr "Show an info box with a link to digital withdrawal in the customer order emails."

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:473
msgid "Hvis feltet ikke er markeret, vises kun en kort note om, at handelsbetingelserne er vedhæftet som PDF, uden link til fortrydelsesfunktionen. Handelsbetingelserne vedhæftes altid som PDF, uanset denne indstilling."
msgstr "If the box is not checked, only a short note that the terms and conditions are attached as a PDF is shown, without a link to the withdrawal function. The terms and conditions are always attached as a PDF, regardless of this setting."

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:493
msgid "Overskriften på info-boksen i ordremailen. Bruges kun når linket ovenfor er slået til. Standard:"
msgstr "The heading of the info box in the order email. Only used when the link above is enabled. Default:"

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:512
msgid "Introteksten i info-boksen. Brug fx til at oplyse, at specialfremstillede varer ikke er omfattet af fortrydelsesretten. Bruges kun når linket ovenfor er slået til. Standard:"
msgstr "The intro text in the info box. Use it, for example, to state that custom-made goods are not covered by the right of withdrawal. Only used when the link above is enabled. Default:"

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:532
msgid "Teksten på linket til fortrydelsesfunktionen. Bruges kun når linket ovenfor er slået til. Standard:"
msgstr "The text of the link to the withdrawal function. Only used when the link above is enabled. Default:"

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:551
msgid "Noten om, at handelsbetingelserne er vedhæftet som PDF. Vises altid, også når linket ovenfor er slået fra. Standard:"
msgstr "The note that the terms and conditions are attached as a PDF. Always shown, even when the link above is turned off. Default:"

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:564
msgid "Her kan teksten til handelsbetingelserne vedligeholdes. Når automatisk indsættelse er slået til, opdaterer pluginet sit eget markerede afsnit på den valgte side, hver gang indstillingerne gemmes."
msgstr "Here you can maintain the text for the terms and conditions. When automatic insertion is enabled, the plugin updates its own marked section on the selected page every time the settings are saved."

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:565
msgid "Bemærk: Denne tekst er kun henvisningen i handelsbetingelserne. Selve fortrydelsesformularen vises ved at indsætte shortcoden [digital_fortrydelse] på den side, tokenet nedenfor peger på."
msgstr "Note: This text is only the reference in the terms and conditions. The withdrawal form itself is displayed by inserting the shortcode [digital_fortrydelse] on the page the token below points to."

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:583
msgid "Vælg side"
msgstr "Select page"

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:589
msgid "WooCommerce handelsbetingelsessiden er valgt som standard."
msgstr "The WooCommerce terms and conditions page is selected by default."

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:591
msgid "Vælg den side, der bruges til handelsbetingelser. Hvis WooCommerce har en handelsbetingelsesside sat, bruges den som standard."
msgstr "Select the page used for the terms and conditions. If WooCommerce has a terms and conditions page set, it is used by default."

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:611
msgid "Opdater automatisk afsnittet i handelsbetingelserne, når indstillingerne gemmes."
msgstr "Automatically update the section in the terms and conditions when the settings are saved."

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:613
msgid "Pluginet erstatter kun indhold mellem sine egne start- og slutmarkører. Hvis markørerne ikke findes, tilføjes afsnittet nederst på siden."
msgstr "The plugin only replaces content between its own start and end markers. If the markers are not found, the section is added at the bottom of the page."

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:632
msgid "Tokens:"
msgstr "Tokens:"

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:633
msgid "klikbart link"
msgstr "clickable link"

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:634
msgid "ren URL"
msgstr "plain URL"

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:635
msgid "De ældre tokens"
msgstr "The older tokens"

#: includes/class-rs-fr-settings.php:636
